{"quests":{"dialogue":[{"id":"brasscap.sheriff","name":"Sheriff Brass","nodes":[{"choices":[{"id":"accept","label":"I'll clear them.","next":"camps","sets":["brasscap.sheriff.met"]}],"id":"offer","lines":["Easy, stranger. Name's Brass: I keep the peace in this canyon, or I did.","Tin bandits hold three camps down the trail, and they shoot back now. Past the gate, the Dust Wyrm.","You've got a lever-action in your hands. Clear the camps, and I'll open the gate for you."]},{"choices":[{"id":"camp-1","label":"Camp 1 is clear.","next":"gate","when":{"all":["dead:bandit.camp-1.1","dead:bandit.camp-1.2","dead:bandit.camp-1.3"]}}],"id":"camps","lines":["Camp 1 sits by the west wall. Mind their pistols: they draw, then fire. Step aside when they draw.","The rack behind me restocks your rounds. There's an ammo box at every camp."]},{"choices":[{"id":"wyrm","label":"The Dust Wyrm is dead.","next":"thanks","sets":["brasscap.sheriff.reported"],"when":{"all":["dead:dust-wyrm"]}}],"id":"gate","lines":["Good shooting. Two marksmen hold the ledge at camp 2: they take their time, so don't stand still.","Clear camp 3 and the gate opens. Their rushers wait past it, and so does the Wyrm. Shoot its gullet when it glows."]},{"choices":[],"id":"thanks","lines":["The Wyrm, dead. The mesa owes you, stranger, and so do I. The bounty's yours."]}],"start":"offer"},{"id":"brasscap.poster","name":"Wanted poster","nodes":[{"choices":[],"id":"read","lines":["WANTED: THE DUST WYRM. It swallowed the 4:15 to Brasscap, carriages and all.","Shoot it in the gullet when it glows. 20 coins, paid by Sheriff Brass."],"sets":["brasscap.poster.read"]}],"start":"read"}],"flags":["dead:bandit.camp-1.1","dead:bandit.camp-1.2","dead:bandit.camp-1.3","dead:bandit.camp-2.1","dead:bandit.camp-2.2","dead:bandit.camp-2.3","dead:bandit.camp-3.1","dead:bandit.camp-3.2","dead:bandit.camp-3.3","brasscap.gate.open","dead:target.1","dead:target.2","dead:dust-wyrm","brasscap.mesa.done","brasscap.bounty.done","brasscap.sherif